{"spread": 17, "blocks": [[{"t": "It\u2019s what shapes his leadership today\u2014", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 61, 432, 75]}, {"t": "practical, grounded, and unshaken by ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 73, 428, 87]}, {"t": "pressure. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 85, 291, 99]}], [{"t": "He\u2019s not one to lead from the sidelines. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 109, 434, 123]}, {"t": "When deadlines tighten and things get ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 121, 435, 135]}, {"t": "chaotic, he stays hands-on, reminds ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 133, 421, 147]}, {"t": "the team why they\u2019re doing what ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 145, 407, 159]}, {"t": "they\u2019re doing, and keeps the bigger ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 157, 419, 171]}, {"t": "picture in view.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 169, 316, 183]}], [{"t": "He hires for attitude. He trains for ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 193, 407, 207]}, {"t": "potential. He leads with presence.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 205, 407, 219]}, {"t": "Because strategy means nothing ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 217, 407, 231]}, {"t": "if your team can\u2019t feel you in the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 229, 405, 243]}, {"t": "trenches when it matters.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 241, 368, 255]}], [{"t": "Across Singapore and Malaysia, Shan ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 265, 425, 279]}, {"t": "leads with a consistent thread\u2014", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 277, 400, 291]}, {"t": "resilience. \u201cHire for attitude and ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 289, 399, 303]}, {"t": "potential,\u201d he says. \u201cThen invest. Train. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 301, 431, 315]}, {"t": "Align on goals. And stay present.\u201d", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 313, 406, 327]}], [{"t": "He knows each market comes with its ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 337, 428, 351]}, {"t": "own rhythm. Regulations differ. Work ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 349, 423, 363]}, {"t": "cultures clash. But adaptability isn\u2019t ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 361, 421, 375]}, {"t": "a skill you teach; it\u2019s something you ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 373, 419, 387]}, {"t": "practise. And Shan\u2019s been practising it ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 385, 432, 399]}, {"t": "for years.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 397, 290, 411]}], [{"t": "The subcontractor model that Mint ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 61, 629, 75]}, {"t": "operates on isn\u2019t always an easy ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 73, 616, 87]}, {"t": "one\u2014but for Shan, the key is clear ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 85, 625, 99]}, {"t": "communication, constant coordination, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 97, 649, 111]}, {"t": "and never assuming something\u2019s under ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 109, 648, 123]}, {"t": "control until you\u2019ve verified it yourself.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 121, 643, 135]}], [{"t": "\u201cThe ones who impress me most ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 145, 614, 159]}, {"t": "aren\u2019t just technically strong. They\u2019re ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 157, 640, 171]}, {"t": "proactive. They solve problems before I ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 169, 648, 183]}, {"t": "even know they\u2019re problems.\u201d", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 181, 599, 195]}, {"t": "Looking back, he\u2019s proud of what Mint ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 193, 643, 207]}, {"t": "has become. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 205, 520, 219]}], [{"t": "But he doesn\u2019t romanticise it. He ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 229, 616, 243]}, {"t": "knows what it took to get here.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 241, 607, 255]}, {"t": "And if there\u2019s one thing he hopes ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 253, 620, 267]}, {"t": "the next generation of engineers ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 265, 619, 279]}, {"t": "understands, it\u2019s this: \u201cBe curious. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 277, 624, 291]}, {"t": "Stay hands-on. Take ownership. And be ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 289, 648, 303]}, {"t": "ready to fall down a few times. That\u2019s ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 301, 639, 315]}, {"t": "where the real learning happens.\u201d", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 313, 618, 327]}], [{"t": "Because in this industry, the path to ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 337, 636, 351]}, {"t": "leadership doesn\u2019t always look like a ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 349, 634, 363]}, {"t": "ladder. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 361, 491, 375]}], [{"t": "Sometimes, it looks like scaffolding\u2014", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 385, 634, 399]}, {"t": "messy, temporary, but strong enough ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 397, 642, 411]}, {"t": "to carry you if you\u2019re willing to climb.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 409, 635, 423]}]]}